abstract: >-
  A static three.js globe that plots sourced UAP and other high-strangeness cases against military, nuclear,
  conflict, water, sky and ancient-site reference layers, with a timeline, dossiers, a link graph, convergence
  hotspots, a hypothesis-testing panel with explicit baselines, generated reports and a full audit trail.
